Comment:
 The /usr/bin/hasura-graphql-engine executable in this package is a modified
 build of the Apache-2.0 licensed Hasura GraphQL Engine community edition,
 built from source by the BigBlueButton project from the fork at
 https://github.com/bigbluebutton/hasura-graphql-engine (release tag
 v2.50.7-bbb.1, commit de214841, based on the upstream tag v2.50.7). The
 modifications relative to upstream are listed in the BBB-CHANGES.md file at
 the root of that fork. The fork is maintained by the BigBlueButton project
 and is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by, Hasura, Inc.; "Hasura" is a
 trademark of Hasura, Inc.
 .
 The /usr/bin/hasura CLI is the unmodified upstream release binary.
 .
 System libraries (glibc, libgmp10, libpq5, libkrb5-3, unixODBC and others)
 are linked dynamically and are therefore package dependencies, not part of
 this package; their licenses ship with their own packages.

